    "title": "Harlingen woman celebrates 109th birthday, shares words of wisdom - NewsBreak",
    "text": "HARLINGEN, Texas ( ValleyCentral ) — A retirement home in Harlingen hosted a 109th birthday celebration for one of its residents on Wednesday. Hazel Laverne Myrick was surrounded by peers and loved ones at Golden Palms Retirement to celebrate the milestone. “I feel really good,” Myrick said. “I’m older than most people, but that’s all right. I still kept my humor.” Myrick, the youngest of eight siblings, recalls her youth with her grandparents, running up and down the hills, and having fun. She shared one piece of advice for a fulfilled life. “Always be honest and sincere,” Myrick said. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KVEO-TV.",
